  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "We apply the options to the given equation & solve it by using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nGiven Equation: 98 − 9 × 21 ÷ 7 + 56 = 69\n\nOption 1) 56 and 9, + and ×\n\nAfter Interchanging:\n\n⇒ 98 − 56 + __**21 ÷ 7**__ × 9 = 69\n\n⇒ 98 − 56 + __**3 × 9**__ = 69\n\n⇒ __**98**__ − 56 __**+ 27**__ = 69\n\n⇒ __**125 - 56**__ = 69\n\n⇒ **69 = 69**\n\nGiven Equation: 98 − 9 × 21 ÷ 7 + 56 = 69\n\nOption 2) 56 and 21, + and ×\n\nAfter Interchanging:\n\n⇒ 98 − 9 + __**56 ÷ 7**__ × 21 = 69\n\n⇒ 98 − 9 + __**8**____** ×**____** 21**__ = 69\n\n⇒ __**98**__ − 9 __**+ **__**__168__** = 69\n\n⇒ __**266 - 9**__ = 69\n\n⇒ 257 ≠ 69\n\nGiven Equation: 98 − 9 × 21 ÷ 7 + 56 = 69\n\nOption 3) 98 and 9, + and ×\n\nAfter Interchanging:\n\n⇒ 9 − 98 + __**21 ÷ 7**__ × 56 = 69\n\n⇒ 9 − 98 + __**3 × 56**__ = 69\n\n⇒ __**9**__ − 98 __**+ 168**__ = 69\n\n⇒ __**177 - 98 **__= 69\n\n⇒ 79 ≠ 69\n\nGiven Equation: 98 − 9 × 21 ÷ 7 + 56 = 69\n\nOption 4) 21 and 7, + and −\n\nAfter Interchanging:\n\n⇒ 98 − 9 + __**7 ÷ 21**__ × 56 = 69\n\n⇒ 98 − 9 + **__0.33__**__** × 56**__ = 69\n\n⇒ __**98**__ − 9 __**+ **__**__18.66__** = 69\n\n⇒ __**116.66 - 9**__ = 69\n\n⇒ 107.66 ≠ 69\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\".**",
